## Implementation Notes for Codex (P1)
- EMA(5,shift5): `iMA(NULL,PERIOD_H1,5,5,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)` — 3rd param is shift
- `double ema75 = iMA(NULL,PERIOD_H1,75,0,MODE_EMA,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- `double bb_mid = iBands(NULL,PERIOD_H1,20,2,0,PRICE_CLOSE,MODE_MAIN,1)`
- `double rsi = iRSI(NULL,PERIOD_H1,14,PRICE_CLOSE,1)`
- LONG: `iClose[1] > ema75 && iClose[1] > bb_mid && rsi > 50`
- SL: swing-5bar-low capped 40 pips; TP: 2×SL
- P3 sweeps: EMA75 period (50/75/100), BB deviation (2/2.5), SL approach (EMA75 vs 5-bar low vs fixed 30p)

